Let's go back to our extreme temperatures, -10°C and 20°C, and do the same thing again.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
df_extreme <- tibble(
  min_temp_coldest_month = c(-10, 20)
)

pred <- predict(
  glm_ht,
  newdata = df_extreme,
  type = "response"
)

pred_df <- tibble(
  min_temp = c(-10, 20),
  predicted_prob = pred
)
gt(pred_df)
```

